{"4504440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Raker", "steam_appid": 4504440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome aboard Star Raker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/87bf6d1c489c6ecb068ff6ee39593daf.poster.avif?t=1785659139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/87bf6d1c489c6ecb068ff6ee39593daf.webm?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/87bf6d1c489c6ecb068ff6ee39593daf.mp4?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Raker is a multiplayer social deduction for 4 to 12 players in which the crew of the evacuation ship takes part in a series of social experiments. The game combines several modes that radically change the rules of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about arcade conventions. The outcome of the match is determined solely by the human factor. Your main weapons here are communication skills, logic, and social engineering.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Available game modes:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Selection (minimum number of players: 4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/eefba37622a5f5c0b7229061d6af97c7.poster.avif?t=1785659139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/eefba37622a5f5c0b7229061d6af97c7.webm?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/eefba37622a5f5c0b7229061d6af97c7.mp4?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenarios inspired by thought experiments, in which you must choose only half of the 8 most deserving players. Each character has 12 unique traits, resulting in over 439,000,000,000,000,000,000,000 (439 sextillion, or 21 zeros)) possible character combinations. Make difficult moral decisions, use facts, and persuade the crew to save the gene pool.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Betrayal (minimum number of players: 4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/53ba09f49fcc56b94c0ca6a77b473020.poster.avif?t=1785659139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/53ba09f49fcc56b94c0ca6a77b473020.webm?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/53ba09f49fcc56b94c0ca6a77b473020.mp4?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden-role games taken to a whole new level. Gather around the table and try to figure out which crew member is up to no good. When trust becomes currency, you’ll have to keep tabs on every move your fellow crew members make, make tough decisions, or use any of the unique abilities from the 13 available roles to survive until the next cycle.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome aboard Star Raker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/87bf6d1c489c6ecb068ff6ee39593daf.poster.avif?t=1785659139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/87bf6d1c489c6ecb068ff6ee39593daf.webm?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/87bf6d1c489c6ecb068ff6ee39593daf.mp4?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Raker is a multiplayer social deduction for 4 to 12 players in which the crew of the evacuation ship takes part in a series of social experiments. The game combines several modes that radically change the rules of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about arcade conventions. The outcome of the match is determined solely by the human factor. Your main weapons here are communication skills, logic, and social engineering.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Available game modes:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Selection (minimum number of players: 4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/eefba37622a5f5c0b7229061d6af97c7.poster.avif?t=1785659139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/eefba37622a5f5c0b7229061d6af97c7.webm?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/eefba37622a5f5c0b7229061d6af97c7.mp4?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenarios inspired by thought experiments, in which you must choose only half of the 8 most deserving players. Each character has 12 unique traits, resulting in over 439,000,000,000,000,000,000,000 (439 sextillion, or 21 zeros)) possible character combinations. Make difficult moral decisions, use facts, and persuade the crew to save the gene pool.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Betrayal (minimum number of players: 4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/53ba09f49fcc56b94c0ca6a77b473020.poster.avif?t=1785659139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/53ba09f49fcc56b94c0ca6a77b473020.webm?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/extras/53ba09f49fcc56b94c0ca6a77b473020.mp4?t=1785659139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden-role games taken to a whole new level. Gather around the table and try to figure out which crew member is up to no good. When trust becomes currency, you’ll have to keep tabs on every move your fellow crew members make, make tough decisions, or use any of the unique abilities from the 13 available roles to survive until the next cycle.</p>", "short_description": "Welcome to Star Raker, a multiplayer social deduction for 4 to 12 players. Take part in a psychological experiment aboard an evacuation ship. Use logic, communication, and social engineering to save the gene pool or survive the paranoia of hidden betrayal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/850cf414fb7f54895a64b9e0faadcb53982fe47b/header.jpg?t=1785659139", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/85fc285984d96ffcc7e287313fd1048bd7c7d3bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785659139", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504440/85fc285984d96ffcc7e287313fd1048bd7c7d3bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1